  "behavior": "One cooperative opening budget spans the fixed native opening capability and actual returned-client/session setup. A monotonic deadline prevents synchronous entry/inspection from winning through timer/microtask order. Cancel the actual timer on transfer/refusal. Retain the original OPEN receipt; stop a late returned client once through its own close without transferring a session, replaying queued commands, writing results, starting another opening or upgrading uncertainty.",
